<title>USA: Texas energy regulator re-elected.</title>
<headline>Texas energy regulator re-elected.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Railroad Commission Chairman Carole Keeton Rylander easily won re-election on Tuesday in a statewide vote.</p>
<p>Rylander, a Republican, led Democratic challenger Hector Uribe by 59 percent to 38 percent with nearly 90 percent of the vote counted.</p>
<p>The Railroad Commission regulates the Texas oil and gas industry.</p>
